        <name>GroupNodes</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::AggressiveAntiDepState::GroupNodes</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Implements a disjoint-union data structure to form register groups. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>A node is represented by an index into the vector. A node can &quot;point to&quot; itself to indicate that it is the parent of a group, or point to another node to indicate that it is a member of the same group as that node. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
